e,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-05-28T03:13:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T20:01:12Z","closed_at":"2025-06-02T19:42:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in godot 4.4 and 4.5 dev 4. Both have same issue\n\n### System information\n\nMacos Sequoia 15.5 (24F74) Macbook pro m4\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using an editor plugin to add new ProjectSettings via ProjectSettings.set_setting(...) it will run fine and then using ProjectSettings.save() it will say Error code 0 (OK). I can view the settings in the project settings window. However it is not saved to project.godot file, and it is not accessible via ProjectSettings.get_setting(...) when running the application. If I change the default in the project settings window itself it will save the override for that one property but not the rest.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nEditor plugin will run on startup, it will print the log saying its saving and the save code, you can view the ProjectSettings and all the way at the bottom see \"Debug Settings\" and all the new fields I added. Do not change the values as that breaks the test and will make it work! \n\nThen you can run the application and it will print out the value of a property I added which will be null since it wasn't saved.\n\nYou can also manually view the project.godot file after running the editor and you will not see the new settings saved there\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[macos_project_settings_save_not_work.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20473722/macos_project_settings_save_not_work.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106889/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106889/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}